<title>USA: PenUltimate changes name.</title>
<headline>PenUltimate changes name.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PenUltimate Inc said Wednesday it had changed its name to MobiNetix Systems Inc in order to more accurately reflect the company's focus on mobile transactions on networks.</p>
<p>The change is effective immediately.</p>
